  "segments": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "start_ms": 120,
      "end_ms": 630,
      "text": "对吧"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "start_ms": 630,
      "end_ms": 2940,
      "text": "我们要向黑格尔学习"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "start_ms": 2940,
      "end_ms": 3840,
      "text": "我们说了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "start_ms": 3840,
      "end_ms": 11620,
      "text": "他这个黑格尔的那个那个啊真当红星黑哥儿"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "start_ms": 11620,
      "end_ms": 12220,
      "text": "你知道吗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "start_ms": 12220,
      "end_ms": 15910,
      "text": "他这个黑字头啊肯定是红色的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "start_ms": 15910,
      "end_ms": 17080,
      "text": "为什么呢"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "start_ms": 17080,
      "end_ms": 22050,
      "text": "因为他黑我的那些东西举报不掉"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "start_ms": 22050,
      "end_ms": 22980,
      "text": "懂吗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "start_ms": 22980,
      "end_ms": 23790,
      "text": "举报不掉"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "start_ms": 23790,
      "end_ms": 26080,
      "text": "很有学术严肃性"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "start_ms": 26320,
      "end_ms": 31100,
      "text": "而且他注册这个邮箱和左翼23注册的邮箱"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "start_ms": 31100,
      "end_ms": 32630,
      "text": "那个非常像"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "start_ms": 32630,
      "end_ms": 34340,
      "text": "都是用的那个质子邮箱"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "start_ms": 34340,
      "end_ms": 36560,
      "text": "还有一个这个黑格尔在2020年的时候"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "start_ms": 36560,
      "end_ms": 38739,
      "text": "就开始给羊和平洗地了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "start_ms": 38940,
      "end_ms": 39930,
      "text": "懂了吧"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "start_ms": 44480,
      "end_ms": 48080,
      "text": "他在这个真当这个呃"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "start_ms": 48080,
      "end_ms": 52250,
      "text": "这个真当这个黑粉头子的啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "start_ms": 52250,
      "end_ms": 53300,
      "text": "这个叫什么"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "start_ms": 54100,
      "end_ms": 56400,
      "text": "这个叫正当红星黑子啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "start_ms": 56400,
      "end_ms": 57660,
      "text": "我在运动当中"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "start_ms": 57660,
      "end_ms": 61360,
      "text": "大奖赛当中是一个最有潜力的选手"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "start_ms": 61540,
      "end_ms": 64610,
      "text": "他创造出了这个独树一帜啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "start_ms": 64610,
      "end_ms": 66770,
      "text": "这个是什么大奖赛征文比赛"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "start_ms": 66770,
      "end_ms": 69470,
      "text": "还有集结成这个论文集的方式来黑我"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "start_ms": 69470,
      "end_ms": 70490,
      "text": "这个就非常好"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "start_ms": 70490,
      "end_ms": 72310,
      "text": "你们所有人要向他学习"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "start_ms": 72310,
      "end_ms": 75360,
      "text": "骂我的时候一定要什么"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "start_ms": 75360,
      "end_ms": 77460,
      "text": "用别人的文章来骂我"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "start_ms": 77460,
      "end_ms": 79400,
      "text": "表明一个中立客观性"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "start_ms": 79400,
      "end_ms": 83120,
      "text": "骂我的时候说我宝说我这个改良主义"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "start_ms": 83120,
      "end_ms": 83990,
      "text": "说我不够激进"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 33,
      "start_ms": 83990,
      "end_ms": 84770,
      "text": "非常好"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 34,
      "start_ms": 84770,
      "end_ms": 86510,
      "text": "说我不懂政治经济学"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 35,
      "start_ms": 86510,
      "end_ms": 88530,
      "text": "非常好非常非常好"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 36,
      "start_ms": 88530,
      "end_ms": 90030,
      "text": "为什么不懂政治经济学"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 37,
      "start_ms": 90030,
      "end_ms": 92920,
      "text": "说明我造反不可能的了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 38,
      "start_ms": 92920,
      "end_ms": 93370,
      "text": "对不对"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 39,
      "start_ms": 93370,
      "end_ms": 94750,
      "text": "没有学术能力"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 40,
      "start_ms": 94750,
      "end_ms": 95800,
      "text": "但马造反"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 41,
      "start_ms": 95800,
      "end_ms": 96400,
      "text": "对不对"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 42,
      "start_ms": 96400,
      "end_ms": 97240,
      "text": "不懂政治经济学"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 43,
      "start_ms": 97240,
      "end_ms": 98980,
      "text": "另外一方面不懂政治经济学"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 44,
      "start_ms": 98980,
      "end_ms": 102800,
      "text": "说明我没有学院派的那些激进的大教授的人脉"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 45,
      "start_ms": 102800,
      "end_ms": 103940,
      "text": "没有人脉"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 46,
      "start_ms": 103940,
      "end_ms": 105200,
      "text": "怎么做到呢"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 47,
      "start_ms": 105200,
      "end_ms": 106360,
      "text": "第三点"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 48,
      "start_ms": 106480,
      "end_ms": 108460,
      "text": "不懂政治经济学"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 49,
      "start_ms": 108460,
      "end_ms": 110920,
      "text": "说明我赚不到钱啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 50,
      "start_ms": 110920,
      "end_ms": 113080,
      "text": "我的这个是没有钱"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 51,
      "start_ms": 114100,
      "end_ms": 114780,
      "text": "对不对"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 52,
      "start_ms": 114780,
      "end_ms": 118350,
      "text": "怎么怎么又怎么怎么来做做这种激进的事情呢"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 53,
      "start_ms": 118350,
      "end_ms": 120600,
      "text": "不懂政治经济学这个批判"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 54,
      "start_ms": 120600,
      "end_ms": 121320,
      "text": "第四点"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 55,
      "start_ms": 121320,
      "end_ms": 123410,
      "text": "他又是一个非常学术性的批判"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 56,
      "start_ms": 123410,
      "end_ms": 126230,
      "text": "弄得文绉绉人物尊尊的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 57,
      "start_ms": 126230,
      "end_ms": 128030,
      "text": "不带人身攻击"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 58,
      "start_ms": 128030,
      "end_ms": 130999,
      "text": "不带脏字儿略有不足"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 59,
      "start_ms": 130999,
      "end_ms": 132319,
      "text": "他有一点点人身攻击"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 60,
      "start_ms": 132319,
      "end_ms": 133939,
      "text": "说我是什么反动分子头子"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 61,
      "start_ms": 133939,
      "end_ms": 136880,
      "text": "这种带有很明显的那种那种色彩的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 62,
      "start_ms": 136880,
      "end_ms": 137660,
      "text": "扣大帽子色彩"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 63,
      "start_ms": 137660,
      "end_ms": 139590,
      "text": "这个话语可以略微单调"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 64,
      "start_ms": 139590,
      "end_ms": 141480,
      "text": "怎么把可以略微删掉"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 65,
      "start_ms": 141519,
      "end_ms": 142389,
      "text": "了解吧"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 66,
      "start_ms": 142389,
      "end_ms": 144579,
      "text": "所以有这四大好处"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 67,
      "start_ms": 144579,
      "end_ms": 148389,
      "text": "真文还有做论文集做出来的文章"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 68,
      "start_ms": 148389,
      "end_ms": 150080,
      "text": "绝对举报不掉"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 69,
      "start_ms": 150359,
      "end_ms": 151199,
      "text": "绝对对"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 70,
      "start_ms": 151199,
      "end_ms": 153740,
      "text": "我是一个非常好的一个黑"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 71,
      "start_ms": 153940,
      "end_ms": 155650,
      "text": "非常好的一个黑"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 72,
      "start_ms": 155650,
      "end_ms": 156760,
      "text": "非常棒"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 73,
      "start_ms": 156760,
      "end_ms": 159100,
      "text": "大家都要向这个黑格尔学习"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 74,
      "start_ms": 159100,
      "end_ms": 161110,
      "text": "要学习黑格尔"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 75,
      "start_ms": 161110,
      "end_ms": 164850,
      "text": "他是这个他的红星黑字头当中的一个"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 76,
      "start_ms": 164850,
      "end_ms": 166920,
      "text": "最有潜力的一个老大哥"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 77,
      "start_ms": 167040,
      "end_ms": 167880,
      "text": "老大哥"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 78,
      "start_ms": 167880,
      "end_ms": 169230,
      "text": "你们都要向他学习"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 79,
      "start_ms": 169230,
      "end_ms": 171990,
      "text": "他这个论文集集结之后呢"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 80,
      "start_ms": 171990,
      "end_ms": 177040,
      "text": "作为一个pdf在海内外的各大媒体传播好"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 81,
      "start_ms": 177040,
      "end_ms": 178630,
      "text": "最好你给他上豆瓣"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 82,
      "start_ms": 178630,
      "end_ms": 180880,
      "text": "给他弄到9.9分"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 83,
      "start_ms": 180880,
      "end_ms": 183610,
      "text": "最好你给他在各个这个群组论坛"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 84,
      "start_ms": 183610,
      "end_ms": 185410,
      "text": "各个个弄什么电报"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 85,
      "start_ms": 185410,
      "end_ms": 187880,
      "text": "小蓝鸟里面那个都给他传播"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 86,
      "start_ms": 187920,
      "end_ms": 189450,
      "text": "传播充分之后"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 87,
      "start_ms": 189450,
      "end_ms": 192660,
      "text": "那大家很多人有些人去一搜索搜未明子"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 88,
      "start_ms": 192660,
      "end_ms": 194040,
      "text": "将收到的就是未名子"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 89,
      "start_ms": 194040,
      "end_ms": 195300,
      "text": "不够格不够造"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 90,
      "start_ms": 195300,
      "end_ms": 196200,
      "text": "未明子很饱"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 91,
      "start_ms": 196200,
      "end_ms": 197220,
      "text": "很改良"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 92,
      "start_ms": 197220,
      "end_ms": 198510,
      "text": "太棒了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 93,
      "start_ms": 198510,
      "end_ms": 200520,
      "text": "严肃的政治经济学分析"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 94,
      "start_ms": 200520,
      "end_ms": 203370,
      "text": "未明子的路线为什么不能走走不通"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 95,
      "start_ms": 203370,
      "end_ms": 204640,
      "text": "太棒了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 96,
      "start_ms": 207179,
      "end_ms": 209440,
      "text": "太好了啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 97,
      "start_ms": 209920,
      "end_ms": 216970,
      "text": "这个黑格尔的这个这个这个黑格尔的这个真文"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 98,
      "start_ms": 216970,
      "end_ms": 217780,
      "text": "真好"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 99,
      "start_ms": 217780,
      "end_ms": 219400,
      "text": "看懂吧"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 100,
      "start_ms": 220660,
      "end_ms": 222480,
      "text": "而且就是通过这种方式"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 101,
      "start_ms": 222480,
      "end_ms": 224870,
      "text": "你就代表一个普遍的声音"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 102,
      "start_ms": 224870,
      "end_ms": 227450,
      "text": "代表一个这个很有代表性的一个声音"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 103,
      "start_ms": 227450,
      "end_ms": 229310,
      "text": "而且你这个论文征文比赛"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 104,
      "start_ms": 229310,
      "end_ms": 233060,
      "text": "可以逢到那种伟人诞辰"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 105,
      "start_ms": 233200,
      "end_ms": 236950,
      "text": "可以不仅他出生的他忌日"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 106,
      "start_ms": 236950,
      "end_ms": 241569,
      "text": "还有各各种重大节日都要办啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 107,
      "start_ms": 241569,
      "end_ms": 243219,
      "text": "最好能够做到月月都办"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 108,
      "start_ms": 243219,
      "end_ms": 245259,
      "text": "每月都办一次啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 109,
      "start_ms": 245259,
      "end_ms": 250489,
      "text": "做成什么1月投喂大奖赛啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 110,
      "start_ms": 250489,
      "end_ms": 251820,
      "text": "什么征文大赏"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 111,
      "start_ms": 251820,
      "end_ms": 253380,
      "text": "2月讨位大奖赛"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 112,
      "start_ms": 253380,
      "end_ms": 253920,
      "text": "征文大赏"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 113,
      "start_ms": 253920,
      "end_ms": 254460,
      "text": "3月吧"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 114,
      "start_ms": 254460,
      "end_ms": 255060,
      "text": "每个月都有"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 115,
      "start_ms": 255060,
      "end_ms": 257640,
      "text": "最好就是互联网上充满了这样的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 116,
      "start_ms": 257640,
      "end_ms": 261000,
      "text": "关于未明子的这种征讨檄文"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 117,
      "start_ms": 261000,
      "end_ms": 262740,
      "text": "声讨五杀不够"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 118,
      "start_ms": 262740,
      "end_ms": 264500,
      "text": "造不够格"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 119,
      "start_ms": 266600,
      "end_ms": 268180,
      "text": "不是个造革人"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 120,
      "start_ms": 269500,
      "end_ms": 272340,
      "text": "只能到闲鱼上买人造革"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 121,
      "start_ms": 274259,
      "end_ms": 276769,
      "text": "高老师太懂吧"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 122,
      "start_ms": 276769,
      "end_ms": 283560,
      "text": "然后尽量天天去吹捧那些格中格格霸"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 123,
      "start_ms": 284100,
      "end_ms": 284900,
      "text": "格霸"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 124,
      "start_ms": 284900,
      "end_ms": 289350,
      "text": "格格霸的那个就是这个八字里面有个格子啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 125,
      "start_ms": 289350,
      "end_ms": 294229,
      "text": "叫做格与格乐格霸啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 126,
      "start_ms": 294229,
      "end_ms": 295969,
      "text": "把把某些老先生"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 127,
      "start_ms": 295969,
      "end_ms": 301020,
      "text": "某些网某某网某某先生他捧成格隆格格霸"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 128,
      "start_ms": 301020,
      "end_ms": 302040,
      "text": "那我很纳闷"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 129,
      "start_ms": 302040,
      "end_ms": 304920,
      "text": "就人家做隔壁做隔中隔做那么多年了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 130,
      "start_ms": 304920,
      "end_ms": 306090,
      "text": "屁事都没有"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 131,
      "start_ms": 306090,
      "end_ms": 307740,
      "text": "像我这我一个宝诶"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 132,
      "start_ms": 307740,
      "end_ms": 310319,
      "text": "老保中保中保啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 133,
      "start_ms": 310319,
      "end_ms": 312179,
      "text": "我是什么保胎丸啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 134,
