      "end_ms": 634550,
      "text": "所以你一定要做到让你的文章举报不掉"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 267,
      "start_ms": 634550,
      "end_ms": 637450,
      "text": "你这次征文的这个形式确实非常好"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 268,
      "start_ms": 637450,
      "end_ms": 638410,
      "text": "确实非常棒"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 269,
      "start_ms": 638410,
      "end_ms": 640150,
      "text": "每一期都有几十个人"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 270,
      "start_ms": 640150,
      "end_ms": 641590,
      "text": "上百个人给你点赞"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 271,
      "start_ms": 641590,
      "end_ms": 642690,
      "text": "非常棒"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 272,
      "start_ms": 642690,
      "end_ms": 645819,
      "text": "下一次我希望你能够努力做到"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 273,
      "start_ms": 645880,
      "end_ms": 648400,
      "text": "每一期都有上千个人给你点赞"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 274,
      "start_ms": 648400,
      "end_ms": 651060,
      "text": "那我就我太高兴了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 275,
      "start_ms": 651340,
      "end_ms": 655780,
      "text": "我我觉得这个反魏大业我做总指挥好吧"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 276,
      "start_ms": 655780,
      "end_ms": 658670,
      "text": "我让我因为我最了解我"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 277,
      "start_ms": 658670,
      "end_ms": 659630,
      "text": "我可黑的吗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 278,
      "start_ms": 659630,
      "end_ms": 661390,
      "text": "我可以提供你们黑掉呀"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 279,
      "start_ms": 661390,
      "end_ms": 662890,
      "text": "我最我就是网红"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 280,
      "start_ms": 662890,
      "end_ms": 663880,
      "text": "我就是丑角"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 281,
      "start_ms": 663880,
      "end_ms": 665170,
      "text": "我就是玩抽象的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 282,
      "start_ms": 665170,
      "end_ms": 668440,
      "text": "我就是玩他妈的什么宋江在在这个朝堂上"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 283,
      "start_ms": 668440,
      "end_ms": 669430,
      "text": "我在吃官司"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 284,
      "start_ms": 669430,
      "end_ms": 671260,
      "text": "用大便往自己身上抹啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 285,
      "start_ms": 671260,
      "end_ms": 672100,
      "text": "我就是宋江"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 286,
      "start_ms": 672100,
      "end_ms": 673060,
      "text": "我就是等着招安呢"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 287,
      "start_ms": 673060,
      "end_ms": 674050,
      "text": "我就是叛徒"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 288,
      "start_ms": 674050,
      "end_ms": 675790,
      "text": "我给你们提供原材料诶"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 289,
      "start_ms": 675790,
      "end_ms": 677830,
      "text": "我作为总司令做不了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 290,
      "start_ms": 677830,
      "end_ms": 679450,
      "text": "我做个后勤大队长"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 291,
      "start_ms": 679450,
      "end_ms": 680140,
      "text": "这种可以吧"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 292,
      "start_ms": 680140,
      "end_ms": 683040,
      "text": "我相当于是反卫大队的后勤大队长"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 293,
      "start_ms": 683120,
      "end_ms": 686320,
      "text": "反胃司令部的后勤大队长"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 294,
      "start_ms": 686320,
      "end_ms": 688480,
      "text": "这个东西非我莫属"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 295,
      "start_ms": 688480,
      "end_ms": 689950,
      "text": "这个植物非我莫属"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 296,
      "start_ms": 689950,
      "end_ms": 692040,
      "text": "你看我今天给你提供多少黑料"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 297,
      "start_ms": 692040,
      "end_ms": 693720,
      "text": "我要手把手教你怎么黑"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 298,
      "start_ms": 693720,
      "end_ms": 695060,
      "text": "我懂了吧"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 299,
      "start_ms": 695400,
      "end_ms": 698400,
      "text": "了解了这个网红信这个抽象性"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 300,
      "start_ms": 698400,
      "end_ms": 699540,
      "text": "这个乐子人啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 301,
      "start_ms": 704610,
      "end_ms": 707400,
      "text": "这个什么东西什么啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 302,
      "start_ms": 707400,
      "end_ms": 711090,
      "text": "用网红经济的那一套成功的扭转了局势"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 303,
      "start_ms": 711090,
      "end_ms": 712620,
      "text": "他的野心"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 304,
      "start_ms": 712620,
      "end_ms": 714240,
      "text": "他的这种妄想能达成吗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 305,
      "start_ms": 714240,
      "end_ms": 715020,
      "text": "大家同意吗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 306,
      "start_ms": 715020,
      "end_ms": 715810,
      "text": "不同意"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 307,
      "start_ms": 720060,
      "end_ms": 721620,
      "text": "这种严肃认真的精神"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 308,
      "start_ms": 721620,
      "end_ms": 723600,
      "text": "对于这样虚伪的丑陋的网红"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 309,
      "start_ms": 723600,
      "end_ms": 724980,
      "text": "要把他批判到死"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 310,
      "start_ms": 726300,
      "end_ms": 728830,
      "text": "让他啊永远在中国革命史上"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 311,
      "start_ms": 728830,
      "end_ms": 730940,
      "text": "在中国这个行这个啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 312,
      "start_ms": 735540,
      "end_ms": 736680,
      "text": "我都给你想好了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 313,
      "start_ms": 736680,
      "end_ms": 737670,
      "text": "怎么骂我了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 314,
      "start_ms": 737670,
      "end_ms": 738960,
      "text": "我后勤大队长啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 315,
      "start_ms": 738960,
      "end_ms": 741300,
      "text": "赶紧用这些文字拼命地辱骂我"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 316,
      "start_ms": 741300,
      "end_ms": 742560,
      "text": "just do that"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 317,
      "start_ms": 742560,
      "end_ms": 744479,
      "text": "只要这东西举报不掉"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 318,
      "start_ms": 744600,
      "end_ms": 746190,
      "text": "那这个东西啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 319,
      "start_ms": 746190,
      "end_ms": 748200,
      "text": "我告诉你写的越多啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 320,
      "start_ms": 748200,
      "end_ms": 750360,
      "text": "其实是越有利于我的实践"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 321,
      "start_ms": 750360,
      "end_ms": 754910,
      "text": "越有利于我做我想做的事情啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 322,
      "start_ms": 754910,
      "end_ms": 756590,
      "text": "不要改变风向"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 323,
      "start_ms": 756590,
      "end_ms": 758180,
      "text": "不要啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 324,
      "start_ms": 758180,
      "end_ms": 761540,
      "text": "转过头来就把我捧得和那个什么阳胜一样"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 325,
      "start_ms": 761540,
      "end_ms": 762920,
      "text": "我也是一个格霸哥"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 326,
      "start_ms": 762920,
      "end_ms": 763580,
      "text": "霸二点"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 327,
      "start_ms": 763580,
      "end_ms": 764360,
      "text": "我是格格"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 328,
      "start_ms": 764360,
      "end_ms": 765320,
      "text": "我不想做格格"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 329,
      "start_ms": 765320,
      "end_ms": 766190,
      "text": "我做不了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 330,
      "start_ms": 766190,
      "end_ms": 767260,
      "text": "我没那个本事"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 331,
      "start_ms": 767260,
      "end_ms": 769030,
      "text": "我一介草民啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 332,
      "start_ms": 769030,
      "end_ms": 770680,
      "text": "我没有背后哦"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 333,
      "start_ms": 770680,
      "end_ms": 772300,
      "text": "我双亲都是普通人"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 334,
      "start_ms": 772300,
      "end_ms": 774310,
      "text": "就我自己也不认"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 335,
      "start_ms": 774310,
      "end_ms": 775840,
      "text": "不认识任何达官贵人"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 336,
      "start_ms": 775840,
      "end_ms": 777770,
      "text": "我屁都不是啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 337,
      "start_ms": 777770,
      "end_ms": 779480,
      "text": "我只想好好的活着"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 338,
      "start_ms": 779480,
      "end_ms": 781740,
      "text": "做点我力所能及的事情"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 339,
      "start_ms": 782120,
      "end_ms": 783680,
      "text": "你非要说我是格"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 340,
      "start_ms": 783680,
      "end_ms": 786350,
      "text": "非要用你那一套非法的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 341,
      "start_ms": 786350,
      "end_ms": 787520,
      "text": "你看我多宝啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 342,
      "start_ms": 790950,
      "end_ms": 792090,
      "text": "你看我保的不得了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 343,
      "start_ms": 792090,
      "end_ms": 793410,
      "text": "我不停的在给你提供弹药"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 344,
      "start_ms": 795870,
      "end_ms": 797010,
      "text": "工团主义的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 345,
      "start_ms": 797010,
      "end_ms": 798640,
      "text": "激进的工团主义的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 346,
      "start_ms": 798640,
      "end_ms": 801280,
      "text": "要你非要用那些话语来形容我的话"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 347,
      "start_ms": 801280,
      "end_ms": 802630,
      "text": "我要用法律武器"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 348,
      "start_ms": 802630,
      "end_ms": 804610,
      "text": "我真的我要法律武器对付地道"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 349,
      "start_ms": 804610,
      "end_ms": 805810,
      "text": "我一定就召唤铁拳"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 350,
      "start_ms": 805810,
      "end_ms": 807610,
      "text": "你你想召唤铁拳干我"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 351,
      "start_ms": 808900,
      "end_ms": 809800,
      "text": "你看我多宝"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 352,
      "start_ms": 809800,
      "end_ms": 811780,
      "text": "我不停在提供材料给你"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 353,
      "start_ms": 811780,
      "end_ms": 813020,
      "text": "you understand"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 354,
      "start_ms": 814240,
      "end_ms": 815220,
      "text": "哎你试试看"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 355,
      "start_ms": 815220,
      "end_ms": 816540,
      "text": "你也要捧杀我诶"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 356,
      "start_ms": 816540,
      "end_ms": 818220,
      "text": "你想捧杀我"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 357,
      "start_ms": 818220,
      "end_ms": 819880,
      "text": "你可以试试看"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 358,
      "start_ms": 819880,
      "end_ms": 821920,
      "text": "你这黑格尔写写这么多"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 359,
      "start_ms": 821920,
      "end_ms": 823180,
      "text": "你目前写了那么多"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 360,
      "start_ms": 823180,
      "end_ms": 824620,
      "text": "都是说我宝说我改良"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 361,
      "start_ms": 824620,
      "end_ms": 825580,
      "text": "说我不够造"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 362,
      "start_ms": 825580,
      "end_ms": 828280,
      "text": "忽然明天就弄个白鸽"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 363,
      "start_ms": 828280,
      "end_ms": 830290,
      "text": "胡志洲红弟弟"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 364,
      "start_ms": 830290,
      "end_ms": 831370,
      "text": "红弟儿"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 365,
      "start_ms": 831370,
      "end_ms": 832540,
      "text": "红孩儿"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 366,
      "start_ms": 832540,
      "end_ms": 834040,
      "text": "今天弄个黑哥"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 367,
      "start_ms": 834040,
      "end_ms": 835660,
      "text": "明天那个红孩儿"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 368,
      "start_ms": 835660,
      "end_ms": 838210,
      "text": "红孩儿那个红可能就是黑色的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 369,
      "start_ms": 838210,
      "end_ms": 840079,
      "text": "黑色的红啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 370,
      "start_ms": 840100,
      "end_ms": 842320,
      "text": "红海尔说又开始吹捧我"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 371,
      "start_ms": 842320,
      "end_ms": 843160,
      "text": "说我隔得不了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 372,
      "start_ms": 843160,
      "end_ms": 844060,
      "text": "说我造的不得了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 373,
      "start_ms": 844060,
      "end_ms": 844840,
      "text": "那这个红孩儿"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 374,
      "start_ms": 844840,
      "end_ms": 845740,
      "text": "那你就要注意了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 375,
      "start_ms": 845740,
      "end_ms": 849730,
      "text": "我一定会用你之前用的那个号"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 376,
      "start_ms": 849730,
      "end_ms": 853859,
      "text": "黑格里面所说的我很饱饱的那些手段来对付你"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 377,
      "start_ms": 854240,
      "end_ms": 858319,
      "text": "因为我不想有任何的这样的威胁"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 378,
      "start_ms": 859320,
      "end_ms": 860240,
      "text": "明白吗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 379,
      "start_ms": 860240,
      "end_ms": 861980,
      "text": "你一照实质性的给老子敌对"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 380,
      "start_ms": 861980,
      "end_ms": 864160,
      "text": "要用召唤铁拳把我干掉"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 381,
      "start_ms": 864160,
      "end_ms": 866050,
      "text": "你注意点啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 382,
      "start_ms": 866050,
      "end_ms": 869110,
      "text": "先吃牢饭的可能是你很有可能是好吧"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 383,
      "start_ms": 869110,
      "end_ms": 870400,
      "text": "那讲到这边啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 384,
      "start_ms": 870520,
      "end_ms": 872380,
      "text": "不最后要总结一下"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 385,
      "start_ms": 872380,
      "end_ms": 873850,
      "text": "要向黑格尔学习"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 386,
      "start_ms": 873850,
      "end_ms": 877480,
      "text": "要向这个红星黑字头的有力竞争者学习"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 387,
      "start_ms": 877480,
      "end_ms": 881090,
      "text": "第一届红星黑子头大奖赛有力竞争者黑格尔"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 388,
      "start_ms": 881090,
      "end_ms": 884390,
      "text": "其他的选手要纷纷向前看看齐啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 389,
      "start_ms": 884390,
      "end_ms": 886100,
      "text": "要是不向他学习"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 390,
      "start_ms": 886100,
      "end_ms": 889500,
      "text": "希望你们可以就是说各显神通啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 391,
      "start_ms": 889500,
      "end_ms": 892470,
      "text": "缤彩纷精彩纷呈啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 392,
      "start_ms": 892470,
      "end_ms": 893100,
      "text": "啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 393,
      "start_ms": 893100,
      "end_ms": 894589,
      "text": "你就各式各样的方式"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 394,
      "start_ms": 894589,
      "end_ms": 899149,
      "text": "能够充实我的这么一个保守主义改良主义哦"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 395,
      "start_ms": 905410,
      "end_ms": 908950,
      "text": "just do it向上学花样百出"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 396,
      "start_ms": 908950,
      "end_ms": 910720,
      "text": "use this"
